# Nx Invocation

## Requirement

Always call nx through `npx`:

```bash
npx nx serve api
npx nx run-many -t build
npx nx graph
```

## Rationale

- nx is a devDependency; `npx` ensures the project's pinned version is used
- Avoids mismatch when nx is also installed globally
- Consistent behavior across dev environments and CI

## In npm Scripts

Scripts in `package.json` already use `nx` directly; npm resolves it from `node_modules/.bin`. No change needed there.
